      {
        "y": 396.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 485,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A journal is a written record of what you have done each day, e.g. a learning journal. It is also a"
      },
      {
        "y": 408.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 492.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "publication containing academic articles, published at regular intervals, e.g. every three months."
      },
      {
        "y": 420.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 474.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Memoirs /ˈmemwɑːz/ are a written record of a person’s own life, typically by a politician or"
      },
      {
        "y": 432.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 160.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "military figure."
      },
      {
        "y": 444.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 518.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "An encyclopedia is a book or set of books containing articles arranged in alphabetical order, dealing"
      },
      {
        "y": 456.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 304.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "with the whole of human knowledge or part of it."
      },
      {
        "y": 468.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 467.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "An anthology is a collection of, for example, poems or short stories by different authors."
      },
      {
        "y": 480.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 441.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A manual is usually a technical book with instructions, for example, a car manual."
      },
      {
        "y": 492.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 475.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A logbook is a book that records events, times, etc., for example, all the journeys made by"
      },
      {
        "y": 504.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 159.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "a lorry or ship."
      },
