      },
      {
        "y": 166.9,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 501.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Rewrite these sentences using words or phrases from the opposite page to describe the"
      },
      {
        "y": 178.9,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 290.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "experience of reading particular books."
      },
      {
        "y": 195.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 448.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 I just could not seem to become involved in the story, so I stopped reading it."
      },
      {
        "y": 207.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 299.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 It’s not very serious, and it’s easy to read."
      },
      {
        "y": 219.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 274.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 It’s dense and very difficult to read."
      },
      {
        "y": 231.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 537,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 Take it to bed with you; it’s just right when you’re settling down at night. All the time I was reading"
      },
      {
        "y": 243.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 314.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "it, I just couldn’t wait to get to the next page."
      },
      {
        "y": 255.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 368.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 You find yourself wanting to read more, it’s so fascinating."
      },
      {
        "y": 267.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 283.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 The book is full of useful information."
      },
      {
        "y": 279.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 375,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 Her second novel did not attract a large number of readers."
      },
      {
        "y": 291.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 468.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 This book contains some great moments of true understanding of how things are."
      },
      {
        "y": 303.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 429.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 It is a pleasantly interesting tale about a boy who nurses an injured bird."
      },
      {
        "y": 315.3,
